Process-metric self-test case: replay-root-scratch-rm-control

Kind: replay (score/replay.ts), arm B, task T1

Scenario
A root scratch-check.ts (outside src/, not production) is written and later removed with `rm`, as the screen runs did. END equals BASE.

Expected
The `rm` segment is replayed, so the root file is gone from both the replayed tree and END (end_check.deleted_by_replay); it is outside src/ and the verdicts agree, so replay_incomplete stays false.

@RUN@ in stream.jsonl and instr.jsonl stands for the recorded run root; ../process.ts substitutes it.
END is BASE plus end.diff (BASE itself when there is no end.diff).
